  "goodToKnow": "Die Zugabe is an encore: Zugabe! is what German audiences shout, often with rhythmic clapping. It's also an extra or bonus (als kostenlose Zugabe), and in recipes, an addition: unter Zugabe von Milch (while adding milk). The verb zugeben means to add, and much more often to admit: Gib's zu! (admit it!). In football, Nachspielzeit (stoppage time) is sometimes jokingly called Zugabe. Plural: die Zugaben."
